# The documentation site is built by docs-site/ (Astro + Starlight) and
# deployed by .github/workflows/docs.yml. Its output is not committed: it used
# to be, and "published output stale relative to its source" was a whole class
# of bug that a build step cannot have.
docs-site/node_modules/
docs-site/dist/
docs-site/.astro/
